cho that not only did  they want nothing to do with this  sponsorship they didn't even see any of  the money after the fact we didn't have  that much of salary done and we kind of  thought okay we just got this huge  sponsor sugar is like  our salaries well not just management  but they basically told us just read  your contract you have two more years so  for whatever it was at the time and then  we don't wanna discuss anything like  yeah we're going to treat it so good I  think  and when Freiburg was trying to leave an  IP the issues got worse you had a lot of  issues getting for example prize money  and everything like that they were  trying to find loopholes in the contract  because even those contracts were not  perfect either  so they kind of like screwed us over  according to Freiburg there was a clause  in their contract that stated they had  the stream for up to 10 hours every  month but when we talked to him and  exist they said some months their travel  schedule and practice schedule was so  intense they couldn't meet that  stipulation we were not able to do that  we were travelling so much and when we  came home after tournament we were  practicing and everything like that but  I was dreaming a little bit but I  probably didn't reach the 10 hours point  and after leaving an IP Hisham then said  oh we will pay you all the price money  and everything but according to Freiburg  when he went to his home to ask about  the prize money he was owed from  starladder kiev he was met with a  different story he some came to me like  a few months later saying we will not be  able to pay the prize money unless you  stream in the hours that you have missed  and apparently it was a lot of hours and  he told me that they would find me with  I think was 25k dollars which was the  same amount of money that they owed me  Courtley I still owe me today that I  haven't streamed in then I contacted the  other guys I was asking him like during  this period like have you guys got