er which was very low we  cannot release exists for this amount to  fnatic I was quite fair and open with it  so I was like you have you have the  opportunity to stay on the bench here  and get paid your full salary the  discussions continued a little bit I  went back on my end and thought okay is  there a situation where we can let him  go  so one fact exists and I said I've  thought about a deal that we can propose  but you have to take your decision  yourself and after a little bit talking  about how it would work practically he  said okay to that so we said okay we'll  do this then I'll speak to fnatic see if  we can get the last piece finalized you  start speaking with them of your  contract but I never pressured him and  told him this is how we're gonna do it  do you understand the bench of a Phil  sorry or this is like the creative way I  can get around it for us to be somewhat  content as well with the outcome of this  so we did that deal we finalized with  fnatic that the terms and then they  started winning  so they went over to win wasg  they want captivate sir and then they  exist agreement fell through because  obviously they didn't want to do the  changes and that's when phase reached  out so I said to exist we can do phase  if you want to on the same terms so  listen I talked to this dude for two and  a half hours and he answered every  single question that I had and we  discussed almost every single allegation  that's been floating out there for the  past month to me as a journalist I  thought it was super important that not  only the players get their perspective  told but hisham and n IP management have  their perspective told and so towards  the end of this two-hour interview I  basically told them hey the floor is  yours please if there's anything that  you want to discuss or tell us on the  record now's your chance and here's what  he told me it has been a rough couple of  three weeks for us and everyone in here  is taking this situations very s